  "basis": "The full-period cooling water temperature change from 2005 to 2014 is calculated as the difference between the 2014 value (10.1°C) and the 2005 value (23.9°C), resulting in a decrease of 13.8°C. However, the routing criterion requires a defined threshold or policy to determine if this change qualifies as 'substantial'. The provided evidence confirms no such threshold or definition is visible on the dashboard or in the records. Therefore, the decision must be made under the condition that substantial-change follow-up requires explicit policy support, which is absent.",
